{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"mdeet-2018-biology-24","exam":"MDEET","year":2018,"subject":"biology","number":24,"points":4,"unitId":"immune","unitLabel":"면역학","topic":"MHC·CD4·CD8","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["immune","ecology"],"stem":"다음은 생쥐의 흉선에서 단일양성 흉선세포가 발달하는 과정을 \n알아보기 위한 실험이다.\n<자료> \n＋CD8\n＋이중양성 흉선세포는 흉선의 겉질상피세포(cortical \n◦CD4\n＋또는 CD8\n＋단일양성 \nepithelial cell)와 상호작용하여 CD4\n흉선세포로 발달한다.\n<실험>\n(가) MHCⅡ 결핍 생쥐에, 야생형 MHCⅡ 또는 CD4와 결합하지\n못하는 MHC Ⅱ를 흉선 겉질상피세포에만 발현시킨다.\n(나) 각 생쥐에서 발달된 단일양성 흉선세포의 종류를 조사한다.\nMHC Ⅱ 결핍 생쥐\nCD4와 \n흉선 \n야생형\n결합하지 \n겉질상피세포에만 \n없음\nMHC Ⅱ\n못하는\n발현시킨 MHC Ⅱ\nMHC Ⅱ\n＋세포\n단일양성 흉선세포\nCD8\n㉠\n㉡\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\n＋세포와 CD8\n＋세포다.\nㄱ. ㉠은 CD4\n＋세포다.\nㄴ. ㉡은 CD4\n＋세포가\nㄷ. 흉선 겉질상피세포에 야생형 MHCⅡ가 존재해야 CD4\n발달한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t041"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t042"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t043"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t044"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t045"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":722,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,47.303,310.4,288.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/mdeet-2018-biology-24/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":236,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,388.503,310.4,94